{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-2-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_2_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_2_1_p001\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本研究的实际适应症为系统性红斑狼疮（SLE），已确认的靶点/机制事实为TYK2抑制剂。本章研究理论依据应据此逐项说明临床问题、标准治疗、未满足需求与本研究的证据缺口。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_2_1_p002\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"临床问题：系统性红斑狼疮（SLE）当前的疾病负担与治疗困境应明确为【待补充：当前疾病负担与治疗困境：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_2_1_p003\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"标准治疗：系统性红斑狼疮（SLE）当前标准治疗（SOC）应项目化、可核查地明确为【待补充：当前标准治疗方案：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_2_1_p004\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"未满足需求：系统性红斑狼疮（SLE）目标人群的未满足临床需求应具体明确为【待补充：目标人群未满足的临床需求：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_2_1_p005\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"证据缺口：本研究拟解决的、现有证据无法回答的不确定性应明确为【待补充：本研究拟解决的证据缺口与不确定性：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"df955727c3e6da6456e54d5c8eb050b5c4bc90bf6ff0eada3fafe3f8938b8fa3"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:b1f1df1e9cf16864741ac947a6d96e387aeecb503f3d38a780ea062b46cf1c65:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:b1f1df1e9cf16864741ac947a6d96e387aeecb503f3d38a780ea062b46cf1c65:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-ca